<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Sep 1-20 palm oil exports 413,743 tns - SGS.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Sep 1-20 palm oil exports 413,743 tns - SGS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor, Societe Generale de Surveillance (SGS) Malaysia Sdn Bhd said on Friday it estimated Malaysia's palm oil exports for Sept 1-20 at 413,743 tonnes compared with 398,288 tonnes in Aug 1-20.</p>
<p>It said the exports comprised 89,955 tonnes of RBD palm oil, 201,241 tonnes of RBD palm olein and 56,960 tonnes of RBD palm stearin. The other products accounted for 65,587 tonnes.  </p>
<p>India was the main buyer during the period, taking 102,239 tonnes, Pakistan at 56,130 tonnes, China at 48,265 tonnes and Egypt at 31,750.</p>
<p>Countries in the European Union bought 25,614 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230-8911)</p>
</text>
